    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21309" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωλο-στροφέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn up clods in ploughing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				2.23.14
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				581.16
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωλο-στροφητέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωλο-στροφία</span></b> , ἡ, <i>turning
				up of clods</i>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωλο-στρόφιον</span></b> , τό, <i>dibble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i></div>
